huanchen-q-2c5b2bfe7bbf273f4f1b","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-ad7935c8e71ef0ec658f","layer":"pei","quote":"兹弱冠，与同郡圈文生，俱称盛德。林宗与二人共至市：子许买物，随价酬直；文生訾呵，减价乃取。林宗曰：‘子许少欲，文生多情；此二人非徒兄弟，乃父子也。’后文生以秽货见损，兹以烈节垂名","attribution":"裴注·《郭林宗传》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":444,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aadc6edeb8d5e1786123","start":9,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-3ed36af5a292a04d9b43","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-a8cd43f2cc0b2f54b12a","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖到陈留，始与兹相见；遂同盟，计兴武事。兹答曰：‘乱生久矣，非兵无以整之！’且言‘兵之兴者，自今始矣’。深见废兴，首赞弘谋。合兵三千人，从太祖入荥阳。力战终日，失利，身殁","attribution":"裴注·《先贤行状》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":443,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aadc6edeb8d5e1786123","start":70,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-70da4aa60d9bdc1806f9","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-a8cd43f2cc0b2f54b12a","layer":"pei","quote":"为车骑将军何苗所辟，司徒杨彪再加旌命","attribution":"裴注·《先贤行状》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":443,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aadc6edeb8d5e1786123","start":41,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-d8e1b1fe36ed0dfb3f57","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-78709bf1a5e891b21d32","layer":"original","quote":"从讨董卓，战于荥阳而卒〖3〗。太祖每涉郡境，辄遣使祠焉","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":427,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":69,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-dcaa2285f639f8c7b20c","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-78709bf1a5e891b21d32","layer":"original","quote":"太祖之初至陈留〖2〗，兹曰：“平天下者，必此人也。”太祖亦异之，数诣兹议大事","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":427,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":30,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-8313539e9d272536b98f","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-e0bf87d51bee3453a4e2","layer":"original","quote":"董卓之乱，太祖与邈首举义兵。汴水之战，邈遣卫兹将兵随太祖","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o012a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2ce0778dff9b29b4e2d1","layer":"original","quote":"邈遣将卫兹，分兵随太祖。到荥阳汴水〖9〗，遇卓将徐荣，与战不利，士卒死伤甚多。太祖为流矢所中，所乘马被创〖10〗。从弟洪以马与太祖〖11〗，得夜遁去。荣见太祖所将兵少〖12〗，力战尽日；谓酸枣未易攻也，亦引兵还。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p021a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-7f5cf881e49e0a8f420f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《世语》曰：“陈留孝廉卫兹，以家财资太祖，使起兵，众有五千人。”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a1384adc90961fc338e0","start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗初平元年：公元 190 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-93d66253e23c705b336d","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c8312ddce42041c69855","layer":"modern","quote":"〖14〗杀太后及弘农王：董卓杀何太后在中平六年（公元 189），但杀弘农王则在第二年的正月。见《后汉书》卷八《灵帝纪》、卷九《献帝纪》。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-449cc7b499c8a1fee35c","start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o008","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9faaac9907c958c4d4d1","layer":"original","quote":"卓到，废帝为弘农王而立献帝〖7〗，京都大乱。卓表太祖为骁骑校尉〖8〗，欲与计事。太祖乃变易姓名，间行东归〖9〗；﹝二﹞出关〖10〗，过中牟〖11〗。为亭长所疑〖12〗，执诣县。邑中或窃识之〖13〗，为请得解。﹝三﹞卓遂杀太后及弘农王〖14〗。太祖至陈留〖15〗，散家财，合义兵，将以诛卓。冬十二月，始起兵于己吾〖16〗。﹝四﹞是岁，中平六年也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":172,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o009","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-20c7e941eb42ee97df8c","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年春正月〖1〗，后将军袁术、冀州牧韩馥、﹝一﹞豫州刺史孔伷、﹝二﹞兖州刺史刘岱、﹝三﹞河内太守王匡、﹝四﹞勃海太守袁绍、陈留太守张邈、东郡太守桥瑁、﹝五﹞山阳太守袁遗、﹝六﹞济北相鲍信，﹝七﹞同时俱起兵〖2〗。众各数万，推绍为盟主。太祖行奋武将军〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o012","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2ce0778dff9b29b4e2d1","layer":"original","quote":"邈遣将卫兹，分兵随太祖。到荥阳汴水〖9〗，遇卓将徐荣，与战不利，士卒死伤甚多。太祖为流矢所中，所乘马被创〖10〗。从弟洪以马与太祖〖11〗，得夜遁去。荣见太祖所将兵少〖12〗，力战尽日；谓酸枣未易攻也，亦引兵还。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p021","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-7f5cf881e49e0a8f420f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《世语》曰：“陈留孝廉卫兹，以家财资太祖，使起兵，众有五千人。”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a1384adc90961fc338e0","start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o035a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-879705d364554277c415","layer":"original","quote":"太祖起义兵讨董卓，至荥阳，为卓将徐荣所败。太祖失马，贼追甚急；洪下，以马授太祖；太祖辞让，洪曰：“天下可无洪，不可无君！”遂步从到汴水。水深不得渡，洪循水得船；与太祖俱济，还奔谯。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":166,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
